abstract: >-
  Code for interpreting cancer-gene rankings with model-matched functional
  screens, paired candidate identities, missing-outcome bounds, donor
  decomposition, continuous depletion measurements and graph comparisons.
keywords:
  - cancer-gene prioritisation
  - functional screens
  - network updates
  - colorectal cancer
  - partial identification
